  "timeout_sec": 30,
  "hints": [
    {
      "tr": "En iyiyi bir değişkende tut (`best = None`); her deneyde `if metric not in run[\"metrics\"]: continue`.",
      "en": "Keep the best in a variable (`best = None`); in every experiment `if metric not in run[\"metrics\"]: continue`."
    },
    {
      "tr": "Eşitlikte öncekinin kalması için yalnızca **büyükse** değiştir: `>`; `>=` değil.",
      "en": "To keep the earlier one on a tie, replace only if **greater**: `>`, not `>=`."
    },
    {
      "tr": "Çözümün tamamı:\n\n```python\ndef best_run(runs, metric):\n    best = None\n    for run in runs:\n        if metric not in run[\"metrics\"]:\n            continue\n        if best is None or run[\"metrics\"][metric] > best[\"metrics\"][metric]:\n            best = run\n    return None if best is None else best[\"run\"]\n\n\nRUNS = [\n    {\"run\": 1, \"params\": {\"model\": \"baseline\"}, \"metrics\": {\"val_accuracy\": 0.75}},\n    {\"run\": 2, \"params\": {\"model\": \"logistic\", \"C\": 1},\n     \"metrics\": {\"val_accuracy\": 0.83, \"val_f1\": 0.61}},\n    {\"run\": 3, \"params\": {\"model\": \"forest\", \"max_depth\": 5},\n     \"metrics\": {\"val_accuracy\": 0.81, \"val_f1\": 0.64}},\n    {\"run\": 4, \"params\": {\"model\": \"logistic\", \"C\": 10},\n     \"metrics\": {\"val_accuracy\": 0.83, \"val_f1\": 0.6}},\n    {\"run\": 5, \"params\": {\"model\": \"forest\", \"max_depth\": 8},\n     \"metrics\": {\"val_accuracy\": 0.8, \"val_f1\": 0.62}},\n]\nprint(best_run(RUNS, \"val_accuracy\"))\nprint(best_run(RUNS, \"val_f1\"))\nprint(best_run(RUNS, \"test_accuracy\"))\n```",
      "en": "The full solution:\n\n```python\ndef best_run(runs, metric):\n    best = None\n    for run in runs:\n        if metric not in run[\"metrics\"]:\n            continue\n        if best is None or run[\"metrics\"][metric] > best[\"metrics\"][metric]:\n            best = run\n    return None if best is None else best[\"run\"]\n\n\nRUNS = [\n    {\"run\": 1, \"params\": {\"model\": \"baseline\"}, \"metrics\": {\"val_accuracy\": 0.75}},\n    {\"run\": 2, \"params\": {\"model\": \"logistic\", \"C\": 1},\n     \"metrics\": {\"val_accuracy\": 0.83, \"val_f1\": 0.61}},\n    {\"run\": 3, \"params\": {\"model\": \"forest\", \"max_depth\": 5},\n     \"metrics\": {\"val_accuracy\": 0.81, \"val_f1\": 0.64}},\n    {\"run\": 4, \"params\": {\"model\": \"logistic\", \"C\": 10},\n     \"metrics\": {\"val_accuracy\": 0.83, \"val_f1\": 0.6}},\n    {\"run\": 5, \"params\": {\"model\": \"forest\", \"max_depth\": 8},\n     \"metrics\": {\"val_accuracy\": 0.8, \"val_f1\": 0.62}},\n]\nprint(best_run(RUNS, \"val_accuracy\"))\nprint(best_run(RUNS, \"val_f1\"))\nprint(best_run(RUNS, \"test_accuracy\"))\n```"
    }
  ],
